<section>
    <h2>Q Format Paper System</h2>

    <p>unit.gl breakpoints are derived from the Q paper format system — a geometric series where each size is 1.5× the
        previous:</p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Physical foundation</strong> — Breakpoints map to real paper dimensions</li>
        <li><strong>4× multiplier</strong> — 1mm = 4px at 96dpi (standard screen density)</li>
        <li><strong>Density-aware</strong> — Scales correctly across device pixel ratios</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Portrait widths serve mobile devices, landscape widths serve desktop:</p>

    <table class="table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Breakpoint</th>
                <th>Full Name</th>
                <th>Step</th>
                <th>Q Format</th>
                <th>Width (mm)</th>
                <th>×4 = px</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>us</code></td><td>Ultra Small</td><td>1</td><td>Q07 Portrait</td><td>60mm</td><td>240px</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>ss</code></td><td>Super Small</td><td>2</td><td>Q06 Portrait</td><td>90mm</td><td>360px</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>xs</code></td><td>Extra Small</td><td>3</td><td>Q05 Portrait</td><td>135mm</td><td>540px</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>sm</code></td><td>Small</td><td>4</td><td>Q04 Portrait</td><td>180mm</td><td>720px</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>md</code></td><td>Medium</td><td>5</td><td>Q04 Landscape</td><td>270mm</td><td>1080px</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>lg</code></td><td>Large</td><td>6</td><td>Q03 Landscape</td><td>360mm</td><td>1440px</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>xl</code></td><td>Extra Large</td><td>7</td><td>Q02 Landscape</td><td>540mm</td><td>2160px</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>sl</code></td><td>Super Large</td><td>8</td><td>Q01 Landscape</td><td>720mm</td><td>2880px</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>ul</code></td><td>Ultra Large</td><td>9</td><td>Q00 Landscape</td><td>1080mm</td><td>4320px</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</section>
